    {
      "id": "stuck-general",
      "title": "If you are stuck",
      "summary": "Who to ask when something is blocked and nobody named in a section can help.",
      "timing": "anytime",
      "body": "If a step is blocked and the people named in its section cannot help, ask these people\nfirst: $general_contacts.\nSay what you tried and what you need. They will point you to someone else to try.\n",
